    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>“You never really travel alone. Caravan chains, sky-routes, migrant camps — the map of where help <em>should</em> be is already in your head.”</em></p>\n<p><strong>Nomad Networks.</strong> You have reroll the lowest die on Presence and Soul checks [TODO(adv-call)] made to find shelter, guides, supplies, or black-market contacts along major travel routes, in caravan towns, or in any inhabited Desert / Ash Wastes / Swamp / Mire hex.</p>\n<p><strong>Route-Sense.</strong> When you spend at least 1 hour in a settlement of any size, the GM tells you one true thing about a route in or out of that settlement that an outsider would not know.</p>",
